SWEET Mali: record bounded allocation and hardware job-result diagnostics

Preserve allocation policy and error codes; identify the failing stage
without logging task or GPU addresses or changing memory limits.
Record the first four terminal job results per client after hardware
completion/fault polling and cache handling, without inferring pixels.

